    {
      "id": "note-brief",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "PAYO revamp v2 — AI-first Home\n\nRow 1: Auth (phone → OTP → create/enter PIN) → Home. The assistant greets by name and offers the five things people come to do; the conversation continues right there. Last frame: listening state.\nRow 2: Home mid-conversation (bill card), Wallet tab (balance, quick actions, activity), Activity, Receipt, Pay, Send\nRow 3: Amount, Confirm, PIN gate, Success, Bills, Savings\nRow 4: Card, Statements, More, Home dark, Home Urdu\nBottom: Motion spec + Design foundations\n\nTabs: Home (assistant) · Wallet · Pay · More. The AI bar stays docked on the other tabs and jumps back to Home.\nThe three Home frames play their motion live — the greeting rises, cards stagger in, the mic breathes, rings pulse while listening, dots while thinking."
    }
  ],
